    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good starting point, but it feels a bit surface-level for a legal discussion. Could you go deeper into the specific arguments for originalism? I'd like to understand the logic they use regarding the historical context of the text. And then can you do the same for the living constitutionalist perspective? I want to see how they reconcile the text with modern realities.",
